	On the Amiga (and maybe other non-Unix systems) the command to
get into Debug mode is:

% nethack -u izchak -D

   "izchak" is lowercase, and came as a result of the original Amiga
port.  The name never got changed back to "Wizard".  I don't know why
this isn't listed in the spoiler file, or the supplied game docs.  It
probably should be.
 
